{"guid": "https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-11-09-radar-bots-directory-botbase/", "title": "Radar - Redesigned Bots Directory on Cloudflare Radar, now powered by BotBase", "summary": "<p>The <a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/radar/\"><strong>Cloudflare Radar</strong></a> <a href=\"https://radar.cloudflare.com/bots/directory\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Bots Directory<span class=\"external-link\"> ↗︎</span></a> now uses <a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/bots/botbase/\">BotBase</a>, Cloudflare's catalog of the bots and agents it tracks, and has a new design matching the Radar homepage.</p>\n<img alt=\"Animation filtering the Bots Directory and opening the Cloudflare Crawler bot page, with its Identity and Traffic sections\" height=\"563\" src=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/cdn-cgi/image/onerror=redirect,width=1000,height=563,format=webp/_astro/radar-bots-directory-botbase.b-N2AJvi.gif\" width=\"1000\" />\n<p>Each bot page has a new <strong>Identity</strong> section showing the bot's access level, content use, <a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/bots/reference/bot-verification/web-bot-auth/\">Web Bot Auth</a> verification, and user agents. Bot operators are also searchable from the Radar site search.</p>\n<div class=\"heading-wrapper level-h4\" tabindex=\"-1\"><h4 id=\"api\">API</h4><a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#api\"><span class=\"anchor-icon\"><svg height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\" fill=\"currentcolor\"></path></svg></span></a></div>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/api/resources/radar/subresources/bots/methods/list/\">List bots</a> and <a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/api/resources/radar/subresources/bots/methods/get/", "url": "https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-11-09-radar-bots-directory-botbase/", "published_at": "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T16:07:51.172582+00:00", "keyword_pass": true, "relevance_pass": true, "change_kind": "material", "importance": 0.68}
